  "id": "contextual-association",
  "term": "contextual association",
  "definition": "Contextual association is the linking of an event or memory to the surrounding situation or environment in which it occurs. In psychology, it is discussed in relation to episodic memory and emotional processing, such as connecting fear or other emotional responses to a particular context.",
